                  \\,,
          %p
            the fully localized action functional. Or rather, this is the case for pure bulk field theory, with no
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/branes"} branes
            or
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/domain+walls"} domain walls
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
