                    %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                    %mo .
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    \\mathbf{Fields} = \mathbf{Fields}(\ast) \in \mathbf{H} \hookrightarrow Span_n(\mathbf{H})
                    \\,.
          %p
            As a corollary of prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FullSelfDualizabilityInSpan"}
            we have:
          #ValueOfLocalPrequantumFieldTheoryOnCobordism.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_2 Proposition
