            %h6#remark_6 Remark
            %p
              By the defining property of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mapping+stack"} mapping stack
              construction, this means that if
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
