            which defines 1-dimensional prequantum Dijkgraaf-Witten theory in
            %a{:href => "#1dDWTheory"} 1d Dijkgraaf-Witten theory
            is equivalently a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cocycle"} cocycle
            in degree-1
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+cohomology"} group cohomology
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
