                  \\,.
          %p
            More familiar are maybe cocycles in higher degree. In view of the above it is plausible that one may interpret a cocycle in degree-
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
