          %p
            Here we discuss the case of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi n
                  %mo =
                  %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n = 2
            where a group 2-cocycle is regarded as the local action functional of a 2-dimensional Digjkgraaf-Witten field theory. We use this as occasion to introduce a bit of the theory of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-groups"} 2-groups
            and their
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+2-type"}> homotopy 2-type
            \-theory). Below in
            %em
              %a{:href => "#3dDWLocalPrequantumFieldTheory"} 3d DW theory
            we then turn to the fully general case of
            = succeed "-theory." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-groupoid"} ∞-groupoid
