          %p (…)
          %h3#HigherChern-SimonsLocalPrequantumFieldTheory Higher Chern-Simons local prequantum field theory
          %p
            By def.
            = succeed "," do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LocalPrequantumFieldWithAction"}
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bulk"} bulk
            field theory in dimension
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi n
                  %mo +
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (n+1)
            is equivalently a morphism of the form
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi exp
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi i
                  %mi S
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi Fields
