          %p
            We see below that both the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wess-Zumino-Witten+theory"} Wess-Zumino-Witten theory
            as well as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wilson+lines"} Wilson lines
            in Chern-Simons theory arise from transgression defects this way.
